  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "新ê舊日誌——記念『米拉』（一）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蔡秋芬</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><i>Chapter I</i></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「我雖然行過死蔭ê山谷，也m̄驚災害，因為你kah我tī--leh。」阮是阿心，是一本簿仔，一本厚厚、烏tòo紅，鑲金墘ê精裝日誌。面頂有印燙金ê西班牙文「<i>Milagros</i>」，意思是「奇蹟之心」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjvGaHrYSZJ2pBW2IY31rPC-dC4MPROmk76urLiv0u_J9mlFd2HeRTGNb3SXV-FzM6LnIE7g9WyvMs182Ovs25B7ux6hG8UJlctlDB7T_KRhoJ6g2ApPCJhTdm8sBWnRmv7ACfLrPmT3_s89CPFG6sT5BPJKqlR1Dat-_DrCqEH8oRdIzIpI2FINCSbAGXr/s600/20230416%20%E6%95%A3%E6%96%87%20%E8%94%A1%E7%A7%8B%E8%8A%AC%20%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%88%8A%E6%97%A5%E8%AA%8C%20%E7%B1%B3%E6%8B%891.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"600\" data-original-width=\"450\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjvGaHrYSZJ2pBW2IY31rPC-dC4MPROmk76urLiv0u_J9mlFd2HeRTGNb3SXV-FzM6LnIE7g9WyvMs182Ovs25B7ux6hG8UJlctlDB7T_KRhoJ6g2ApPCJhTdm8sBWnRmv7ACfLrPmT3_s89CPFG6sT5BPJKqlR1Dat-_DrCqEH8oRdIzIpI2FINCSbAGXr/w480-h640/20230416%20%E6%95%A3%E6%96%87%20%E8%94%A1%E7%A7%8B%E8%8A%AC%20%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%88%8A%E6%97%A5%E8%AA%8C%20%E7%B1%B3%E6%8B%891.jpg\" width=\"480\" /></a></div><br /><span><a name='more'></a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê主人家是一个活跳熱情，軟心溫暖ê查某囡仔，名叫阿珊。阿珊伊雞卵面，膨皮好笑神，兩片喙脣lio̍h仔厚厚，鼻仔nah-nah，目睭liu-liu-tshiu-tshiu活靈靈，掛圓圓ê烏色粗框目鏡，淡薄仔天然呆ê款式，不而過伊永遠笑文文，he笑面是冬尾時天ê日頭，燒lō人心。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊大學音樂系出業，前幾年去美國ê音樂學院深造修習。Tsit-má回tńg台灣，踮學校做音樂老師leh教鋼琴兼教台語。Mài掠準伊少年m̄ bat世情，就看貓無點，人阮tsit个主人是一位「俠女」，雖bóng tsiah 20外歲，行tsiūnn街仔路贊聲抗爭、反對不義ê事項，伊在來無leh躊躇，無一kái有làu-kau--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不而過，今仔日ê記錄是日誌ê上尾篇，是伊tsit世人ê最後一篇文章，徛算án-ne，阮猶原堅信煞鼓就是起碇，收束就是開始。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時間徙跤到秋天，月到中秋特別明。Ing暗是中秋暝，月娘低低，tsiok圓tsiok光，家家戶戶重逢團圓，無疑悟suah是災厄ê陷眠。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">〈天光進前〉</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Tī萬底深坑ê烏暗眩</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Onn-onn睏ê人</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>滿天ê霜雪　ná花m̂掖</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Ná羽毛飛</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>白白ê糖粉　幼膩kō塗跤</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>所有ê沉重</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>輕báng-báng</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>一切ê兇狂</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Lóng擋恬</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>行程慢且是</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>車路tsiâu無--去</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>阮求--你　就tsit kái</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>一kái就好</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Hē願　歡喜恬靜</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>光明　世間降臨</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>※　※　※</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><i><b>Before the Dawn</b></i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>In the deep dark bottomless cave</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>People sleep like a log</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Snowflakes run wild</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Like falling blooms</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Shaking feather</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>As white powdered sugar</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Glued with the ground</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><br /></i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Hey! You seem down in the dumps</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>And life is always in a rush</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Why not take your time then slow down?</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>'Cause haste just makes waste</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>We beg God for once</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>And once for all</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>May hope and peace</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Born as the rising sun</i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><b>Chapter II</b></i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit日，阿珊伊腹肚疼kah實在是擋bē tiâu，規sian人un tī塗跤phi̍h-phi̍h-tshuah，凊汗流bē煞。「阿母、阿母……」伊人tī三樓ê房間，ku--leh半行半爬，倚近手機仔，khà電話hiàm踮一樓灶跤tng-leh煮晝ê母--à——阿敏。In母--à阿敏手攑煎匙拄拄leh參虱目魚大戰第二回合，耳空聽著客廳ê電話leh giang，緊mé kā煎kah金黃赤脆ê虱目魚thuh起去大塊phiat仔，雙手tī暗色全全油tái ê圍軀裙頂面huê-huê--leh，tsông tuì客廳去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Uê，借問lán tueh beh揣？Uê，你哪ē m̄講話？」「阿母，我是阿珊，我腹肚tsiok疼……」聽見心肝查某囝虛lám ná khuì絲ê聲，伊三步做兩步peh樓梯tsiūnn三樓，siam著喙脣píng白，頭鬃hōo重汗浸tâm ê阿珊，心內大tio̍h驚，隨kā伊插落一樓門口埕，叫計程仔直透tshia去病院檢查。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透中晝，tī急診室外口，阿敏喙內一直leh nauh：「觀世音菩薩，大慈大悲救苦救難，眾佛祖大神明，lín tio̍h tàu保庇……」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時間ná沙漏仔，暝日粒積。傷痕一日一日加、一年一年添，自來m̄ bat piànn掃清氣，又koh一層一層疊--起-去。無的確有影無人ē-sái看thàng你ê siáu鬼仔殼，不而過內中ê傷khî suah愈來愈濟，一直lóng無ka-la̍uh身。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><i>Chapter III</i></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春去秋來，歲月流轉，阿珊到美國修習鋼琴已經滿兩年。伊在來活骨，適應環境本tsiânn就m̄ bat tîng-tânn--過，西方國家又koh phīng台灣開放自由濟濟，伊頭殼內tīnn-tīnn ê idea tī&nbsp; tsit搭tsiâu lóng有可能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Lán來創一个弦樂社，去偏遠ê區域教散赤ê囡仔唱聖歌、唸聖經，好--無？」「你是食飽siunn閒leh換iau iah是頭殼pha-tái、歹--去？Hia-ê烏人囡仔phí哪是lán有才調thang管教--ê？得失bē起--lah！」「無試哪ē知，驚驚bē tio̍h等！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就án-ne，阿珊khiú三个同窗好友，一行四名，隨人kuānn kah大包細包，和齊駛一台自家用ê細隻紅車到tiàu遠ê地區，去教hia ê囡仔唱歌詩、唸聖經。Tshím頭仔，hia-ê囡仔豚無人leh tshap-siâu--in ，想講高級音樂學院ê好學生哪ē看家己tsiūnn目、為家己用心？不而過，時間、熱情ē-sái化解偏見、lua̍h平giâu疑，沓沓仔，願意來參加ê學生囡仔ná來ná濟，一个傳十个，十个傳百个，mā勻勻仔有一个歌唱班ê pān勢--ah。阿珊教唱歌ê時滿面含笑，宛然開tī翠青tsínn軟樹ue頂，水紅水紅、淺淺ê花蕊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「阿珊，你明年出業了後，kám beh隨tńg去台灣？」「我iáu-koh leh考慮，檢采ē ke蹛--一-冬，去美國其他所在lau-lau se̍h-se̍h--leh……後禮拜歇睏日，lán來去黃石公園好--無？聽講有ba̍t-ba̍t是ê怪奇石頭，我tsiok想beh去看--neh！」「幾粒仔石頭參黃塗一phiàn，thài有啥mih好趣味心適？你就是無時得定，規工pìnn東pìnn西、想空想縫。」「人生短短一目nih，想beh做ê代誌即時tio̍h-ài去做，哪無，跤手慢鈍是ē bē赴市。」「正經無你法，kan-na ē-sái殘殘陪你liâu--落-去。」伊ê同窗好友頭殼ná幌，笑聲ná tân。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê主人就是tsit款huah行就行、講做就做ê人，自來m̄ bat有一絲絲仔躊躇驚惶。阮tiānn leh想，tsiah-nī濟ê主張、想法，到底是tuì tueh bùn--出-來--ê？伊ê頭殼內tsiâu leh想啥？凡勢因由阮單單是一本hông鎖tī暗sàm無光ê屜仔內ê舊日誌，所擺無才調來理解--伊。不而過，阮真知阿珊日後百面是一粒一ê頭人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><b>Chapter IV</b></i></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮beh回tńg台灣--ah，tńg去故鄉台中，hit个深深厚厚ê鄉愁ē-sái thàu放ê所在。阮手拖一跤29吋ê柑仔色行李箱，內中是阮踮美國ê一切，想beh透世人留--落-來，suah無應該繼續沉bih siàu念ê記持。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">旅行重頭定義lah-sap ê意義，阮面thái-ko頭鬃油leh-leh、衫仔烏汁汁長褲破糊糊，不而過阮是清氣--ê，因由阮ê心明白靈澄。阮ê操心peh腹留tī hia，回tńg ê阮知影家己beh做啥。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頂頭tsit段文字是阿珊自美國飛台灣ê hit日半暝寫--ê，凡勢是時差，伊規暝無眠，精神tsiânn好，一時心適興，留落tsit段記錄，阮感覺真有詩意。是講旅行tsit層代誌bē輸pua̍h-kiáu，若好空，kā心靈洗thuā清氣，雖bóng人烏衫破，手tsíng甲有tiâu塗沙，你心內猶原感動牽綿綿。若歹運，無啥mih轉變，就án-ne恢復平素時仔ê生活，又koh如何？人生宛然一个小小ê水窟仔，水tīnn水khó，滋味猶原仝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿珊tī美國教烏人囡仔唱歌詩、唸聖經，伊智覺雖bóng in生活散赤無好過日，suah是真心leh hām伊交陪puânn-nuá，伊mā看見in ê團結，便若有siáng兜需要鬥跤手--ê，隨有人贊聲sio-kīng，in雖無錢銀，m̄-koh有情有義。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>（後期繼續）</b></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiSPzgMBerWxMRwRpAsarDPsD_PhhYAzEFWPEpzgupbITyB2i4VNZO_RHkkJfURuLyzlvi9qTcNWtUKhbtyaE9YEmX-YX3IioyEFPD1GuUkIWMXu1daGNnuiN0kCLCnlRJWZTXsYiT-VZz9W9QrafoYpcSuHm04CZbDAGmgEd0SYHFLAuhD2j8mkj6F6n-n/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiSPzgMBerWxMRwRpAsarDPsD_PhhYAzEFWPEpzgupbITyB2i4VNZO_RHkkJfURuLyzlvi9qTcNWtUKhbtyaE9YEmX-YX3IioyEFPD1GuUkIWMXu1daGNnuiN0kCLCnlRJWZTXsYiT-VZz9W9QrafoYpcSuHm04CZbDAGmgEd0SYHFLAuhD2j8mkj6F6n-n/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjULJIhmO8YZ6gj0MTWA1Zs1neQRewTKiAA0-cdecWIQ9mzVBkx2OPU8zZ4h9YO0y0WPASpavEzQXB7L5pLVu4qsoTKFqRAslraIliF7qOtZNwMB2VGWsI9A6A3sQ3XB7ygv6G1G3XYgFF0xp4UI04R4Vui7JMOrcpJ1Ub1dMe3JiplqGv7evXGB7Fu_Ke8/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_18.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjULJIhmO8YZ6gj0MTWA1Zs1neQRewTKiAA0-cdecWIQ9mzVBkx2OPU8zZ4h9YO0y0WPASpavEzQXB7L5pLVu4qsoTKFqRAslraIliF7qOtZNwMB2VGWsI9A6A3sQ3XB7ygv6G1G3XYgFF0xp4UI04R4Vui7JMOrcpJ1Ub1dMe3JiplqGv7evXGB7Fu_Ke8/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_18.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJPp0w23Fso-WvYcc-28Y-DIK65F-_mBgAMWC5nMdNN1RC-KB57owngNFAXWXBCJxiByerdDpCtoUBlW1AAKEH_oVHX_mAmJmBgrZ17q790wzXtrdiWzhg9pxULAD4Ah-eQZclF95FzN-wHI01jks0qCTTMGZCMQWq7to_jUNcWglmpjS25sIqa_mH1it-/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJPp0w23Fso-WvYcc-28Y-DIK65F-_mBgAMWC5nMdNN1RC-KB57owngNFAXWXBCJxiByerdDpCtoUBlW1AAKEH_oVHX_mAmJmBgrZ17q790wzXtrdiWzhg9pxULAD4Ah-eQZclF95FzN-wHI01jks0qCTTMGZCMQWq7to_jUNcWglmpjS25sIqa_mH1it-/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhAl2aHdalgziiP4Qqk9dcNQYgX2E0FdPRg0cEHEwm4Ib-VNQcVXNFzcNdO-Rsjzdij3r3HvYHVZMSrXNdmgel5BQpkJi-DQhEFik1d-PSqWx-LV719gw2H3pRYUl64TgyddgZ7Vi03XbPf9uQheEk4Zgr4AREG4CweEkajLXdmlfKrDi2DjN05eAbGsBIZ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhAl2aHdalgziiP4Qqk9dcNQYgX2E0FdPRg0cEHEwm4Ib-VNQcVXNFzcNdO-Rsjzdij3r3HvYHVZMSrXNdmgel5BQpkJi-DQhEFik1d-PSqWx-LV719gw2H3pRYUl64TgyddgZ7Vi03XbPf9uQheEk4Zgr4AREG4CweEkajLXdmlfKrDi2DjN05eAbGsBIZ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2